      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/43/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/43/eng@/~cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/43/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 55b of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(3) This section shall not apply to a member of the Fund who has attained the age of fifty-five years who falls within the category of the member of the Fund under paragraph 54(1)(c) or (e) or paragraph 70c(1)(b) or (c).”. New Eighth Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/43/eng@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/43/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after the Seventh Schedule the following schedule: “Eighth SchEdulE [Sections 53d and 53E] ELECTION BY A MEMBER OF THE FUND TO TRANSFER HIS CONTRIBUTIONS Transfer of contributions of a member of the Fund into the account of another member of the Fund who is or are his lawful wife or wives (1) Subject to the criteria specified in columns (1) and (2) of the following table, a member of the Fund may elect to transfer his contributions at the rate specified in column (3) into the account of another member of the Fund who is or are his lawful wife or wives and their marriage has been registered under the laws of Malaysia. (2) The transfer of contributions may be ceased by the member of the Fund who elects to transfer his contributions upon the occurrence of any of the following circumstances: (a) dissolution of marriage between the member of the Fund who elects to transfer his contributions and the member of the Fund who receives the contributions transferred; (b) death of the member of the Fund who receives the contributions transferred. (1) (2) Criteria of a Criteria of a member of the member of contributions to be Fund who elects the Fund who transferred to transfer his receives the contributions contributions transferred The member of the The member of 2% Fund— the Fund is a Malaysian citizen 11% (a) is a Malaysian citizen or is not a Malaysian citizen; and (b) receives employer’s contributions on a monthly basis The total contributions which includes cents shall be rounded to the ”. next ringgit"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/43/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/43/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Employees Provident Fund (Amendment) Act 2019."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/43/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/43/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Minister by notification in the Gazette and the Minister may appoint different dates for the coming into operation of different provisions of this Act. Amendment of section 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/43/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/43/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
